  "slug": "room-block-post-event-review-form",
  "title": "Room Block Post-Event Review Form",
  "subtitle": "Close the block after the group leaves: pickup against contract, attrition, revenue per available room, service failures, and rebooking position.",
  "description": "An original post-stay review for a contracted room block. It reconciles contracted, picked up, and consumed room nights, records the attrition and billing position, measures arrival and service performance, captures the group's outcome and rebooking intent, opens actions for findings, and records what should change in the next block.",
  "use_case": "Use after a group departs, when sales, rooms control, and accounting must agree on what the block actually consumed and whether it should be rebooked on the same terms. The review closes when the billing position is agreed and every finding has an owner.",
  "risk_tier": "A",
  "sections": [
    {
      "key": "review_identity",
      "title": "Review identity and participants",
      "guidance": "Bind the review to the block and the people who ran the stay.",
